FINDINGS #C987 1ab7673 (Security 11-12): F1 MEDIUM, page threadOpen. The new early return hides the owner's last word for ANY closed ask when it predates the close, not only asks the board closed. closeRefusal lets the asker close its own ask (a Decision or Answer once answered, other types any time), so an agent closing its ask silences a real owner question posted before the close (say a follow-up after a help answer), where before only an ack-only word on a settled ask was hidden. Fix: limit the new condition to asks the board closed (closed_by board or auto_closed_at, carried to the waiting doc), with a test that an asker's own close still lists the owner's earlier non-ack word. Rest checked: migration 0029 is additive (two nullable columns); every new query is bound; moved_at is set only inside updateCard on a real value change and is not a writable field; the auto-close needs Manager's take and skips help answers; reason text is a number and an MT time. LOW, noted only: any role that can write a card's next_note can start the 30 min clock on an answered, taken Decision; the owner's answer stays and Manager gets a line first.
